<title>USA: Beverly wins legal round on reinstatement.</title>
<headline>Beverly wins legal round on reinstatement.</headline>
<dateline>CHAMBERSBURG, Pa. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Beverly Enterprises Inc said on Tuesday a federal judge vacated an injunction requiring the company to rehire workers who went on strike last April.</p>
<p>Beverly has rehired all but 68 of the Service Employees International Union who walked off their jobs in a strike the company said was illegal due to improper notice being given.</p>
<p>The National Labor Relations Board was granted the injunction, which now has been lifted. An evidentiary hearing is scheduled for February 19.</p>
</text>
